Apple has now <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/03/16/apple-announces-airpods-max-2/">announced</a> the <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/airpods-max/">AirPods Max 2</a>, bringing the first major hardware upgrade to Apple's over-ear headphones since their debut. So how does the new model compare with both earlier versions of ‌AirPods Max‌?<br/>
